{"4391580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unwelcome Guests", "steam_appid": 4391580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391580/extras/d5ab6064f93f7c0968625a513eee2dee.avif?t=1782398691\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unwelcome Guests</strong> blends brutal difficulty and meaningful upgrades with replayability and bite-sized dungeons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the Master of a Dark Fort. Awakened after a 100-year slumber, you realise your fortress has been breached by pesky adventurers! Fight monsters and man alike, and track down Aal, your cursed mirror chief of staff. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavily inspired by Mörk Borg and dark fantasy media, <strong>Unwelcome Guests</strong> should appeal to fans of Hexen, Heretic, Hands of Necromancy, and Project Warlock! See if you’ve got what it takes to best the dungeons and master your abilities! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391580/extras/af7cf8518f2b2c0c23a8e193074ee3e1.poster.avif?t=1782398691\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391580/extras/af7cf8518f2b2c0c23a8e193074ee3e1.webm?t=1782398691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391580/extras/af7cf8518f2b2c0c23a8e193074ee3e1.mp4?t=1782398691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Lacrima and upgrade your character!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a colourful, yet moody art direction!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through short, pick-up-and-play sized dungeons with narrative elements that push you forward!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit an evolving hub world that changes as you upgrade and progress through the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully hand-drawn, hand-animated and fully voice acted narrative that brings this world to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391580/extras/a14e18d5e5f3f0a25de02cf56ee88d25.avif?t=1782398691\" width=1200 height=402 /></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391580/extras/d5ab6064f93f7c0968625a513eee2dee.avif?t=1782398691\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unwelcome Guests</strong> blends brutal difficulty and meaningful upgrades with replayability and bite-sized dungeons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the Master of a Dark Fort. Awakened after a 100-year slumber, you realise your fortress has been breached by pesky adventurers! Fight monsters and man alike, and track down Aal, your cursed mirror chief of staff. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavily inspired by Mörk Borg and dark fantasy media, <strong>Unwelcome Guests</strong> should appeal to fans of Hexen, Heretic, Hands of Necromancy, and Project Warlock! See if you’ve got what it takes to best the dungeons and master your abilities! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391580/extras/af7cf8518f2b2c0c23a8e193074ee3e1.poster.avif?t=1782398691\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391580/extras/af7cf8518f2b2c0c23a8e193074ee3e1.webm?t=1782398691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391580/extras/af7cf8518f2b2c0c23a8e193074ee3e1.mp4?t=1782398691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Lacrima and upgrade your character!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a colourful, yet moody art direction!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through short, pick-up-and-play sized dungeons with narrative elements that push you forward!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit an evolving hub world that changes as you upgrade and progress through the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully hand-drawn, hand-animated and fully voice acted narrative that brings this world to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391580/extras/a14e18d5e5f3f0a25de02cf56ee88d25.avif?t=1782398691\" width=1200 height=402 /></span></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A Mörk Borg-inspired first-person shooter that combines brutal dungeon runs with narrative progression and a stylized hand-drawn 3D aesthetic.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391580/75d7b645a184348ccb7bb6fdd84550313e72bc54/header.jpg?t=1782398691", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391580/4cc8567581b40a88d6a3f7d319275748a06af45b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782398691", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4391580/4cc8567581b40a88d6a3f7d319275748a06af45b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782398691", "